      "avatar": "https://gaming-cdn.com/images/avatars/31934695-1795604576.jpg",
      "sentiment": "dislike",
      "content": "Over Hyped, the price drop is great but still over priced. The game gives watch dog 2 and cyber punk graphics, which is only expected from next Gen games. 2 to 6 forced major differences than the other games, which is lazy In my opinion after all those years. Finally the story, seemed like it was written by a reddit moderator, and don't get me started on all the bigot accents. Only a certain (KKK) group of people can listen to their voices for hours."
    },
