      "avatar": "https://gaming-cdn.com/images/avatars/11695961-1653842280.jpg",
      "sentiment": "dislike",
      "content": "Super fun idea and messes with the brain! Too much in fact for those whom suffer from easy motion sickness. This WILL cause it early on, so if you wish to still play, take it in in very small doses. 2 people in our household got an upset head and stomach for the rest of the day after around 1 hour of gameplay."
    },
